[N 43-45 Stranglethorn Vale]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Ironforge (Tabetha's Task from Bink), Stormwind (Rhapsody's Tale to Brohann) and Nethergarde Keep (Thadius Grimshade, who gives Nekrum's Medallion for Zul'Farrak), then Booty Bay: Deliver to MacKinley, Witch Doctor Unbagwa and Mokk the Savage, the three Voodoo Dues ogres, and the Bloodsail captains on their ships south of town. Ends on the boat to Ratchet.]
