[OC]|cffffffffLevel 45|r  -  this chapter wants level 45: not for its pickups (the highest required level here is 41, Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar; Message in a Bottle needs 45 and is optional) but for the Bloodsail ships: Captain Stillwater is 45-46, Captain Keelhaul 46-47 and Fleet Master Firallon 48, each with a crew of Sea Dogs (43-45), Elder Magi (44-45), Deckhands (43-44) and Swabbies (42-44). Mokk (44) and the three ogres (43-44) come first. Under 45, the expected case (about 44): the ships stay last, Stillwater first and Firallon last; pull the crew one at a time and clear the deck before the captain. Message in a Bottle only at 45
[OC]|cffffffffIronforge to Booty Bay|r  -  you start at Gryth Thurden in Ironforge after chapter 48 with hearth = Aerie Peak, and bind Booty Bay on arrival. About 19,400 quest XP on the five plain quests and 50s of quest money; every giver and hand-in comes from the DB
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Rhapsody's Tale (1469) goes to Brohann in Stormwind, Thadius Grimshade (2990) to Nethergarde Keep, Deliver to MacKinley (2874) and Voodoo Dues (609, if you took it) to MacKinley in Booty Bay; a Rescue OOX quest (2767, 836) to Oglethorpe if you have one. Bags: the 10 Gorilla Fangs from chapter 45
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r the level 44 row is chapter 48's; Eldrun below is the fallback. After Ironforge the next shaman trainer is Ironforge in chapter 52

